sequenceDiagram

    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker
    participant Outbox
    participant Process

    Client->>Controller: Submit task / workflow
    Controller->>DB: Persist logical task
    Controller->>DB: Create physical attempt

    Controller->>Worker: TaskAssignment

    Worker->>Outbox: Persist TaskAccepted
    Outbox->>Outbox: fsync
    Worker->>Controller: TaskAccepted

    Controller->>DB: Attempt → RUNNING
    Controller-->>Worker: EventAck

    Worker->>Outbox: Remove acknowledged event

    Worker->>Process: fork / exec
    Process-->>Worker: exit + stdout + stderr

    Worker->>Outbox: Persist TaskResult
    Outbox->>Outbox: fsync
    Worker->>Controller: TaskResult

    Controller->>DB: Persist result + timeline
    Controller-->>Worker: EventAck

    Worker->>Outbox: Remove acknowledged event
